  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Democracy in Action: strengthening electoral integrity, political accountability, and civic participation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to strengthen Moldova&#x2019;s democratic institutions, safeguard electoral integrity, and foster greater civic participation in the lead-up to and beyond the 2025 parliamentary elections. By addressing key vulnerabilities within the electoral process, political accountability, and public engagement, the project aims to reinforce Moldova&#x2019;s democratic foundations and ensure a more transparent and participatory political environment.  
A core focus of the initiative is on electoral integrity and independent observation, ensuring that elections are conducted fairly and transparently. Through rigorous monitoring, the project will help detect and prevent fraud, vote-buying, and foreign interference, which have increasingly threatened Moldova&#x2019;s democratic processes. Alongside these efforts, the project will advocate for greater transparency in political financing and stronger enforcement of anti-corruption regulations. By supporting legislative improvements and reinforcing parliamentary oversight mechanisms, it will contribute to enhancing the accountability of political institutions.  
In parallel, the project will work to increase civic engagement by implementing widespread voter education and Get Out The Vote (GOTV) initiatives. Public awareness campaigns will provide citizens with accurate information about the electoral process while mobilizing key demographic groups.  
Through these targeted interventions, the project will help build a more informed electorate, restore public trust in democratic institutions, and contribute to Moldova&#x2019;s long-term commitment to European integration. By promoting electoral transparency and reinforcing institutional resilience, this initiative will play a crucial role in shaping a stable and democratic future for the country.</narrative>
  </description>
